  "Deux bornes de limites différentes ne coincent pas la suite : 1 + (−1)ⁿ est entre 0 et 2 sans converger. Il faut deux bornes de même limite.": "Two bounds with different limits do not squeeze the sequence: 1 + (−1)ⁿ lies between 0 and 2 without converging. You need two bounds with the same limit.",
  "Deux conditions : f dérivable en tout point, et f′ continue. x²·sin(1/x) est dérivable sur ℝ, mais f′ n'est pas continue en 0.": "Two conditions: f differentiable at every point, and f′ continuous. x²·sin(1/x) is differentiable on ℝ, but f′ is not continuous at 0.",
