  "Dérive : il apparaît u′ = {du}, et l'intégrale n'a pas exactement ce facteur. Ajuste la constante.": "Differentiate: u′ = {du} appears, and the integral does not have exactly this factor. Adjust the constant.",
  "Dérive Arctg(x²) : 2x/(1 + x⁴). Il y a un facteur 2 de trop : la primitive est ½Arctg(x²).": "Differentiate Arctg(x²): 2x/(1 + x⁴). There is an extra factor 2: the antiderivative is ½Arctg(x²).",
  "Dérive Log(1 + x²) : 2x/(1 + x²), pas 1/(1 + x²). ∫ u′/(1 + u²) = Arctg u.": "Differentiate Log(1 + x²): 2x/(1 + x²), not 1/(1 + x²). ∫ u′/(1 + u²) = Arctg u.",
  "Dérive Log({d}) : tu obtiens {p1}/({d2}), pas {f}. Une fraction en 1/(1 + u²) donne un Arctg : ∫ u′/(1 + u²) = Arctg u.": "Differentiate Log({d}): you get {p1}/({d2}), not {f}. A fraction in 1/(1 + u²) gives an Arctg: ∫ u′/(1 + u²) = Arctg u.",
