  "Limite de x²·f(x) en +∞ (critère de convergence)": "Limit of x²·f(x) at +∞ (convergence test)",
  "Limite latérale prise avec le mauvais morceau": "One-sided limit taken with the wrong piece",
  "Limite remarquable sans le facteur de l'argument": "Standard limit without the factor of the argument",
  "Linéarise {fn}²x.": "Linearize {fn}²x.",
  "Linéariser": "Linearize",
  "Linéariser : {fn}²x = (cosh 2x {p1} 1)/2": "Linearize: {fn}²x = (cosh 2x {p1} 1)/2",
