  "Σ (−1)ⁿ/(√n + (−1)ⁿ) « converge par Leibniz »": "Σ (−1)ⁿ/(√n + (−1)ⁿ) “converges by Leibniz”",
  "Σ (−1)ⁿ/n « converge absolument »": "Σ (−1)ⁿ/n “converges absolutely”",
